<title>USA: Beloit, Wis., $2.480 mln won by Nike Securities.</title>
<headline>Beloit, Wis., $2.480 mln won by Nike Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities said it won $2.480 million of Beloit, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997 A, with a net interest cost of 4.78 percent.</p>
</text>
